title: "pov-recovery: preserve full ancestry recovery at unannounced ancestors"
doc:
  - audience: [Node Dev, Node Operator]
    description: |
      Continue full parachain candidate recovery after reaching an ancestor that
      was not announced as a pending candidate. This preserves the collected
      ancestry and queues it for recovery instead of silently abandoning the
      request. No API changes or migration are required.
crates:
  - name: cumulus-client-pov-recovery
    bump: patch
